    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hotel escalate\nPOST { sessionId, question, name?, email?, phone?, conversation? } to /hotel-escalate.\nEmails the escalation to hotel staff and, in parallel, upserts the guest in hotel_guests (matched by email) and saves the question and transcript in hotel_escalations.\nResponds { ok: true } once the email step completes; the database branch never blocks the guest-facing response.\nSet the recipient in the Build Escalation Email node (ESCALATION_RECIPIENT).",
